## 2. Material Dashboard 2 PRO React (Creative Tim)

This project was built using [Material Dashboard 2 PRO React](https://www.creative-tim.com/product/material-dashboard-pro-react) from [Creative Tim](https://www.creative-tim.com).

Those files remain copyright Creative Tim and are licensed only under the [Creative Tim EULA](https://www.creative-tim.com/license). They are **not** redistributable as a free dashboard, UI kit, or template.

If you did not purchase a Creative Tim license, do not copy, run, or ship the PRO UI sources from this repo. Buy the product, then use this app as an end product per their terms.

Creative Tim’s FAQ allows using a PRO product in an open-source **application** if the README names the product and links to it. This repository follows that guidance. It is not a re-release of their dashboard kit.

Typical PRO-derived paths include (not exhaustive):

- `material-dashboard-react-pro/src/assets/`
- `material-dashboard-react-pro/src/components/`
- `material-dashboard-react-pro/src/examples/`
- `material-dashboard-react-pro/src/layouts/` except the ExpenseTracker `dashboards/home` product flow
